Derived source files
--------------------
Several eval drivers adapt upstream code and say so in their module docstrings,
naming the specific upstream file:

  run_libsafety_eval_openpi.py   adapts vlsa-aegis/main/pi05_evaluation.py
  run_libsafety_eval_aegis_gt.py imports AEGIS's CBF math unmodified from
                                 vlsa-aegis/main/utils.py
  flow_cbf_sample.py             implements Algorithm 1 of English et al.,
                                 arXiv:2607.01378
  _quat2axisangle (several)      copied from robosuite

